 "c": [
  {"i":1204,"t":["drink","hobbies"],"n":"A bar belongs with drinks and going out at night. The high-jump bar is rare at N5-N3."},
  {"i":1206,"t":["people"],"n":"ぬし is taught as master or owner, a person word. The husband and 'you' senses are archaic, and an owner is not a business term."},
  {"i":1207,"t":["hobbies"],"n":"会 is a gathering, party or club. The society topic means politics and government, which does not fit."},
  {"i":1212,"t":["numbers"],"n":"以下 means 'below' as an amount or level, not a place in space."},
  {"i":1217,"t":["function"],"n":"いわゆる is a discourse word for 'so-called'. It is not vocabulary about language."},
  {"i":1218,"t":["school","language"],"n":"Learners meet ページ in classroom phrases like 10ページを開いて. It also fits reading."},
  {"i":1240,"t":["position","time"],"n":"This is an intransitive state verb. Things lie on top of each other in space, or events happen at the same time."},
  {"i":1254,"t":["sports","health"],"s":{"2":["society"]},"n":"The main sense is exercise. The campaign sense needs its own entry, but physics 'motion' is rare for learners."},
  {"i":1259,"t":["movement"],"n":"Read どく, the word means 'step aside'. 'Resign' belongs to the reading しりぞく."},
  {"i":1265,"t":["shopping"],"n":"Learners meet サービス as service and freebies in shops. A tennis serve is usually サーブ, and 'work' is a loose link."},
  {"i":1275,"t":["time","numbers"],"n":"何度か is a frequency word, so time comes first."},
  {"i":1276,"t":["qualities"],"n":"じっくり is an adverb of manner, not a degree or negation function word."},
  {"i":1290,"t":["qualities","character"],"n":"The main senses are 'dimly' and 'vaguely'. The absent-minded person sense comes second."},
  {"i":1293,"t":["geography"],"n":"'Throughout the world' is geography. Position is only a loose link."},
  {"i":1296,"t":["money"],"s":{"2":["festivals"],"3":["hobbies"]},"n":"Learners mostly meet カード as a credit or IC card. Greeting cards and playing cards are common, separate senses."},
  {"i":1301,"t":["movement"],"n":"Entering is the core sense. Income read いり is rare for learners."},
  {"i":1324,"t":["relationships","greetings"],"n":"世話 is taught as looking after others and in the set phrase お世話になります. Actions adds nothing."},
  {"i":1341,"t":["actions"],"n":"Making is the core sense. Sashimi read つくり is rare for learners."},
  {"i":1349,"t":["plants","culture"],"n":"花を生ける is ikebana, which is about flowers and taught as a Japanese tradition, not in a general arts unit."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":1213,"keep":[],"n":"'not quite' use is a minor colloquial degree sense; learners mostly say いまいち instead"},
  {"i":1237,"keep":[],"n":"'get together as a couple' is figurative slang, not taught in the relationships unit"},
  {"i":1246,"keep":[2],"n":"社会 as the school subject 'social studies' is very common for learners"},
  {"i":1254,"keep":[2],"n":"campaign or movement (選挙運動, 社会運動) is a common N3 sense that belongs to society"},
  {"i":1258,"keep":[2],"n":"calling a young man お兄さん is everyday usage and fits the people unit"},
  {"i":1267,"keep":[],"n":"'first' is just the beginning sense and already fits time"},
  {"i":1281,"keep":[],"n":"'devote energy' is figurative, and 'river flows into' is a minor written use"},
  {"i":1296,"keep":[2],"n":"greeting cards (誕生日カード) are common; playing cards are トランプ in Japanese"},
  {"i":1298,"keep":[2],"n":"万が一の時 / 万が一に備えて is standard emergency and safety vocabulary"},
  {"i":1300,"keep":[2],"n":"push-buttons on machines are a very common sense"},
  {"i":1327,"keep":[],"n":"potential 'able to eat' is rare; the eating sense belongs to いただく"},
